  "prefLabel": "Mil 102.02 Meetings",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mil 102.02 Meetings.\n\n(a) The board shall hold meetings on the call of the chairman or the commissioner.\n\n(b) Meetings shall be held at a location specified by the chairman or the commissioner.\n\nSource. #7313, eff 7-1-00",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/mil100-300.html"
